# Evaluate

<Aside title="Reserved — coming when EvalCard ships" data-variant="not">

Evaluate recipes will be added as the EvalCard runtime contract ships. The
`EvalCard` spec is authored and the JSON Schema is checked in; the runtime
implementation is not yet available.

</Aside>

Evaluate capability covers:

- Scoring agent runs against task definitions in CI
- Comparing model outputs against collected production records
- Running `wyrd eval` from the CLI

These how-to pages will be added alongside the EvalCard runtime. See what runs
today in the [Overview](/overview/).
